  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Kerin 18",
  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elia gi jotuci wac were pa Bal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma hongo moro, i oro mar'adek ma kec, Rwoth owaco ri Elia ni, “kadhi inyuthere ruwaŋ Ahab, aka abino dhiro koth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Elia okadho nyuthirok ruwaŋ Ahab. Kec oyido kec swa i Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Ahab olwoŋo Obadia m'oyido jatel ma cel pa kere. (Onyo Obadia oyido lworo Rwoth swa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka ndir ma Yezebel oyido neko jotuci wac Were, Obadia otero jotuci wac Were miya acel aka okano jo i ŋungu i kitipin ario ma piero abic to miyo jo cemo kodi pi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahab owaco ri Obadia ni, “Weyi wakadhi wanen waŋ pi kodi milelo je ma lowo me, poyo wanyalo nwaŋo lum to wabotho kwo pa kayina kodi punde, aka wakiri wakeŋ ogwaŋe mawan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jopoko thenge ma lowo ma kisi nyatoro woluwi, aka jonywako yo m'opokere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo Obadia oyido wotho, oromo gi Elia. Obadia oniaŋ kwoŋ Elia aka okule piny to penjo ni, “Adieri meno in jadwoŋ!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia odwoko ni, “Ey me an. Kadhi iwaci ri jadwoŋ perin nike anitie ka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obadia odwoko ni, “Raco aŋo m'atimo ma imito kethan i teko ma tho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwoŋere rin i nyingi Rwoth, Were perin makwo nike Ahab otieko dwarin i piny je kosa ker. Kisi ka jadhum ma piny moro owaco nike ingoye i piny pere, Ahab oyido miyo go kwoŋirok nike jok'onwaŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka iwaco nike akidhi awaci rigo nike initie ka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyalo waco ri Ahab nike initie ka, to tekin akadho cuny pa Rwoth to tiŋin terin i kabedo ma k'oŋeyere to Ahab nekan. Poyi nike wok i soye paran tundo gunyo ni, alworo Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fodi ikiwinjo ye nike ndir munyo Yezebel oyido neko jotuci wac Were pa Rwoth akano miya acel kwoŋ jo i ŋungu i kitipin ario ma piero abic, t'amiyo jo cemo kodi pi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno anowaci nedi ri Ahab nike initie ka? Go bino nekan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia odwoko ni, “Acikin i nyingi Rwoth pa lwak jolweny makwo m'atiyo rigo nike abino nyuthere ruwaŋ kere konon me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Obadia okidho bongi Ahab aka owaco rigo. Ahab okidho romo gi Elia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Ahab oneno Elia, owaco ri Elia ni, “Meno in jakeli teko i Isiraili!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia odwoko ni, “Aŋat'akikelo teko i Isiraili, to in kodi peco pa benin. Wikwero luwo or pa Rwoth aka wilamo cal pa Bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo miy or wocoki Joisiraili je joworom kodan i Got Kamel, jotuci wac were pa Bal 450 kodi jotuci wac were 400 pa were madhako Asera ma Yezebel thielo jo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Ahab ocoko Joisiraili je kodi jotuci wac were pa Bal i Got Kamel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia ocore cegin gi ji je aka openjo jo ni, “Wilamedere bedo gi paro ario kiri keraŋo? K'inen Rwoth obedo Were, lam win go, to ka Bal obedo Were lam win go?” To jok'odwoko wac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Elia owaco ni, “An kendan a jatuci wac Were pa Rwoth m'odoŋ, to nitie jotuci wac were pa Bal 450. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keli win thwondhe ario. Jotuci wac were pa Bal jowoteri acel jowothum, jowoyaŋ mathindho to joketho i wi yen. To jokiri jowocwiny mac. An bende alatimo gimoro acel gi thwon man mere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi jotuci wac were pa Bal jowokway were pajo, aka abino kwayo Rwoth, aka Were m'odwok ka dhiro mac, meno a Were.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji je jodwoko ni, “Iluwo maber.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Elia owaco ri jotuci wac were pa Bal ni, “Paka win withoth, yer win thwon acel aka wipen thumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Wikiri wicwiny mac, to kway win were mewin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotuci wac were pa Bal jokwanyo thwon m'okel rijo, jothumo, to jokwayo Bal wok odikin tundo sawa aucel. Jokoko ni, “Dwoki wan Bal!” Jomielo thoko migam m'oyido jogeto, to ngoye ŋat'odwoki jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tundo sawa aucel Elia ocako timo gi nyero gi jo ka waco ama: “Kway win malo, go were! Kono okadho woth, kosa go nindo aka wiripo cewo go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jokwayo malo to jothumere g'apalin kodi abor manyakwer pajo cuka remo ocwer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jomedere kiri othieno, to ngoye ŋat'odwoki jo, mayindo k'owinjere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Elia owaco ri ji je ni, “Core win cegin bongan.” Ji je jocore cegin bonge. Elia oyiko migam pa Rwoth m'oyido otur piny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 32:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka okwanyo telin apar g'ario ma jocungo ri nonin pa wot Yakobo, jacwo ma Rwoth omiyo nyinge ni Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi telin me Elia ogeto migam ma lamo Rwoth. Elia okunyo fereji manyalo madho pi lita apar g'aŋwen thoko migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ocano yen i wi migam, oyaŋo thwon mathindho, to ketho i wi yen. Kenyo go owaco ni, “Poŋi win pi i agwatin aŋwen me aka wikonji i wi yen gi mic awaŋa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia owaco kendo ni jowokonji madirio gi ma didek, aka jotimo ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi omol thoko migam, aka opoŋ i fereji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo ma miyo cowirok m'othieno jatuci wac Were Elia ocore cegin gi migam to kwayo ni, “A Rwoth, Were pa Abraham, Isaka, kodi Yakobo, weyi woŋey konon me nike ibedo Were pa Isiraili, nike abedo ŋeca perin, aka nike atimo gime luwo i cik perin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwokan, awi Rwoth, dwokan, ŋey ji me jowoŋey nike in Rwoth, Ibedo Were, aka nike idwoko jo bongin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo mac pa Rwoth opodho aka owaŋo woko mic awaŋa, yen, telin, rudino, to naŋo woko pi m'oyido nitie i fereji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ji je joneno, jogore piny aka jokoko ni, “Rwoth obedo Were, Rwoth obedo Were!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia omiyo or womaki jotuci wac were pa Bal je m'ongoye ŋata wokwale. Ji jomako joje, aka Elia otero jo piny i malawa Kison to neko jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gike ma milengela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Elia owaco ri Ahab ni, “Onyo inyalo kadho icemi. Awinjo mor pa koth bino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.5.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 5:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kucel munyo Ahab okadho cemo, Elia oidho wi Got Kamel, okule piny, to ketho wiye i dier conge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia owaco ri ŋeca pere ni, “Kadhi iŋiy yu nam.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋeca pere okidho to ŋiyo, aka odwoko to waco ni, “Ongoye gim'aneno.” Elia ooro ŋeca pere dibirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma dibirio mere ŋeca pere odwoko to waco ni, “Aneno pondeponde mathin ma kidwoŋ kada loyo cingi dhano wok i nam.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elia omiyo ŋeca pere cik waco ri kere Ahab nike woidhi cawila pere wokadhi mafodi koth k'oŋolo go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo macek won pondeponde macol oumo polo gi koyo m'okudho to koth madwoŋ cwe. Ahab ogweyo cawila pere to dok i Yezirel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meni obino kwoŋ Elia, otweyo nangin pere i piere aka oŋweco yuwiy Ahab kiri i waŋkac ma Yezirel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
